+
+- ✅ AC1: 5 Layer 全部查到 (approvals.mode / hooks / loopback / card/actions / reply_to_message_id)
+- ✅ AC2: 6 install state 全部覆盖 (clean / installed / stale_unpatched / owned_incomplete / corrupt_owned / refused)
